Falsifies `elf::note::verification::a_note_segment_is_read_inside_itself`.

The defect: the walk reads a note header without first checking that twelve bytes remain. A segment
whose length is not a whole number of notes, which a hostile file can arrange freely, then indexes
past its end.

Expected to fail: an index out of bounds in `u32le`, reached from `find_in_segment`.

